:0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4303606315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118843#issuecomment-4303606315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118843","id":4303606315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAIPSKw","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-23T10:21:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T10:30:10Z","body":"Seems it's a platform specific issue related to Windows and Pinyin IME, we may need more works after #118848 . This should probably not be the solution to this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4303606315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4303773928","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118843#issuecomment-4303773928","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118843","id":4303773928,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAIZg6A","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-23T10:50:40Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T19:05:04Z","body":"Apply these changes on #118848\r\n\r\n```patch\r\nSubject: [PATCH] use ImmSetCompositionFont\r\n---\r\nIndex: platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp\r\nIDEA additional info:\r\nSubsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP\r\n<+>UTF-8\r\n===================================================================\r\ndiff --git a/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp b/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp\r\n--- a/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp\t(revision 579b5a92ce349563a2ba318f648ada004389d0fb)\r\n+++ b/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp\t(date 1776939370202)\r\n@@ -136,6 +136,13 @@\r\n \tcps.ptCurrentPos.y = p_pos.y;\r\n \tImmSetCompositionWindow(p_himc, &cps);\r\n \r\n+\tLOGFONT logFont = {};\r\n+\r\n+\tlogFont.lfHeight = 1; // em height\r\n+\tlogFont.lfQuality = CLEARTYPE_QUALITY;\r\n+\r\n+\tImmSetCompositionFont(p_himc, &logFont);\r\n+\r\n \tCANDIDATEFORM cf = {};\r\n \tcf.dwIndex = 0;\r\n \r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/immdev/nf-immdev-immsetcompositionfontw\r\n\r\nUse `ImmSetCompositionFont` might resolves this issue and works on Pinyin IME and Japanese IME (Microsoft)\r\n\r\n`lfHeight` grow the value will effect on Pinyin IME.\r\n\r\n\r\n> lfHeight = 5\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"128\" height=\"100\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d58acce-b1a0-4dd8-a46a-c20e6f18746f\" />\r\n<img width=\"208\" height=\"145\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0481ad2d-b7fe-4b45-b7de-6f76f69d15e7\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n> lfHeight = 1\r\n\r\n<img width=\"131\" height=\"99\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13b7f891-27af-48d9-bc81-46bdbc65b582\" />\r\n<img width=\"226\" height=\"135\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e4fd989-7e4a-4995-954d-d80765238952\" />\r\n\r\n> lfHeight = 0\r\n\r\n<img width=\"183\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/845efa8a-de00-4338-9a3d-2f55a1491483\" />\r\n\r\nIf zero, the document tell `The font mapper uses a default height value when it searches for a match.`\r\n\r\nI think it can resolve this issue by setting a value of `lfHeight` and use `ImmSetCompositionFont`.\r\n\r\nIf right, should I create another pr on this?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4303773928/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4304157860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118843#issuecomment-4304157860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118843","id":4304157860,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAIw8pA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-23T11:57:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T11:57:10Z","body":"> I think it can resolve this issue by setting a value of lfHeight and use ImmSetCompositionFont.\r\n> If right, should I create another pr on this?\r\n\r\nThis makes sense, we do [something similar for the web IME](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/583596cd50bbdd29c5ee033d944410035eeb87fb/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_input.js#L133). I will test it tomorrow.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4304157860/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4307202900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118843#issuecomment-4307202900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118843","id":4307202900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABALqzVA","user":{"